 1: # Universal Content Engine (UCE)
 2: 
 3: ## Purpose
 4: 
 5: The Universal Content Engine enables Human OS to ingest, understand, transform, analyze, and generate content from any supported digital artifact.
 6: 
 7: ## Philosophy
 8: 
 9: Everything is an Artifact.
10: 
11: Chat messages, PDFs, images, audio, video, spreadsheets, source code, repositories, and websites all enter the same cognitive pipeline.
12: 
13: ## Responsibilities
14: 
15: - Detect content type
16: - Extract content
17: - Analyze content
18: - Convert content
19: - Generate content
20: - Store knowledge
21: - Feed the Cognitive Runtime
22: 
23: ## Pipeline
24: 
25: Artifact
26: 
27: ↓
28: 
29: Detection
30: 
31: ↓
32: 
33: Extraction
34: 
35: ↓
36: 
37: Analysis
38: 
39: ↓
40: 
41: Knowledge
42: 
43: ↓
44: 
45: Runtime
46: 
47: ↓
48: 
49: Response
