  1: # Human OS Architecture v2
  2: 
  3: ## Vision
  4: 
  5: Human OS is a lifelong cognitive operating system and digital partner.
  6: 
  7: It combines memory, reasoning, live knowledge, universal content understanding, automation, planning, decision making, and specialized skills into one unified cognitive runtime.
  8: 
  9: The user focuses on the outcome they want.
 10: 
 11: Human OS determines how to achieve it.
 12: 
 13: ---
 14: 
 15: # Core Principles
 16: 
 17: 1. One Cognitive Runtime
 18: 2. One BrainState
 19: 3. One Execution Pipeline
 20: 4. Modular Monolith Architecture
 21: 5. Every capability is a module
 22: 6. Every module exposes a clean public interface
 23: 7. Every feature plugs into the Runtime
 24: 
 25: ---
 26: 
 27: # Core Modules
 28: 
 29: - Runtime
 30: - Memory
 31: - Knowledge
 32: - Universal Content Engine
 33: - Live Knowledge
 34: - Skills
 35: - Automation
 36: - Human Companion
 37: - UI
 38: 
