110: Public Alpha
111: 
112: ---
113: 
114: # Engineering Rules
115: 
116: - Every milestone must compile.
117: - One milestone = one Git commit.
118: - No duplicate logic.
119: - No bypassing the Runtime.
120: - Runtime owns cognition.
121: - Modules communicate through public contracts.
