  1: # Human Journey
  2: 
  3: Version: 1.0
  4: 
  5: Status: Living Document
  6: 
  7: ---
  8: 
  9: # Philosophy
 10: 
 11: Human OS is not software that users install.
 12: 
 13: Human OS is a relationship that grows.
 14: 
 15: Every day the relationship becomes stronger.
 16: 
 17: Every conversation becomes more valuable.
 18: 
 19: Every action becomes more personalized.
 20: 
 21: ---
 22: 
 23: # Day 1
 24: 
 25: A new user opens Human OS.
 26: 
 27: Human OS does not immediately ask:
 28: 
 29: "What can I help you with?"
 30: 
 31: Instead it says:
 32: 
 33: "Before we begin...
 34: 
 35: I'd love to understand you."
 36: 
 37: Human OS starts learning.
 38: 
 39: Not interrogating.
 40: 
 41: Conversing.
 42: 
 43: The user should finish onboarding feeling understood.
 44: 
 45: ---
 46: 
 47: # First Week
 48: 
 49: Human OS begins remembering.
 50: 
 51: Favorite foods.
 52: 
 53: Sleep schedule.
 54: 
 55: Projects.
 56: 
 57: Work.
 58: 
 59: Relationships.
 60: 
 61: Goals.
 62: 
 63: Communication style.
 64: 
 65: The user notices:
 66: 
 67: "I don't need to repeat myself."
 68: 
 69: ---
 70: 
 71: # First Month
 72: 
 73: Human OS starts making suggestions.
 74: 
 75: "You normally work best in the morning."
 76: 
 77: "You've postponed this task three times."
 78: 
 79: "You haven't called your parents recently."
 80: 
 81: "You wanted to exercise this week."
 82: 
 83: Human OS becomes proactive.
 84: 
 85: ---
 86: 
 87: # Three Months
 88: 
 89: Human OS understands patterns.
 90: 
 91: Energy levels.
 92: 
 93: Productivity cycles.
 94: 
 95: Learning preferences.
 96: 
 97: Decision making.
 98: 
 99: Strengths.
100: 
101: Weaknesses.
102: 
103: It begins coaching instead of reacting.
104: 
105: ---
106: 
107: # Six Months
108: 
109: Human OS becomes a trusted partner.
110: 
111: The user naturally asks:
112: 
113: "What do you think?"
114: 
115: Instead of:
116: 
117: "Can you answer this?"
118: 
119: Human OS now understands context behind the question.
120: 
121: ---
122: 
123: # One Year
124: 
125: Human OS knows:
126: 
127: Goals
128: 
129: Projects
130: 
131: Relationships
132: 
133: Habits
134: 
135: Career
136: 
137: Health
138: 
139: Knowledge
140: 
141: Communication
142: 
143: Calendar
144: 
145: Tasks
146: 
147: Learning
148: 
149: Preferences
