151: It becomes the user's external brain.
152: 
153: ---
154: 
155: # Five Years
156: 
157: Human OS has grown with the user.
158: 
159: It remembers:
160: 
161: Important moments.
162: 
163: Career changes.
164: 
165: Businesses.
166: 
167: Failures.
168: 
169: Successes.
